<title>GERMANY: German bourse says IBIS trade to start soon.</title>
<headline>German bourse says IBIS trade to start soon.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German stock exchange said on Thursday its IBIS electronic securities trading system would start full trading at 0845 GMT and that the pre-trade phase had already begun.</p>
<p>Trading had failed to start at the usual time of 0730 GMT because of technical problems. The pre-trade phase usually starts around 0715 GMT.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
